uilt);\n# neutral changes like this move a design's Fmax by far more than nextpnr\n# seeds do (EXP-2026-09-27-v2-placement-noise), so one netlist is one\n# draw. Set from that calibration; see research/v2/NOTES.md.\n# 9 pairs: one wave on the run host (EXP-2026-09-28-v2-noise-server fixes\n# P=9 and derives the acceptance margin for it).\nPERTURBATIONS = [(0, 1)] + [(7 * i, i + 1) for i in range(1, 9)]\n# The final champion's Fmax for the headline score is measured afresh on\n# perturbations and seeds the loop never used: the loop's number was\n…[15207 of 18279 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:799d9a27012937f3]…\n-r6s1/cores/bench/generated/timing/gowin_p0/impl/pnr/core_bench.power.html\" completed\nGenerate file \"/srv/hwebench/clones/gpt-6-astra_xhigh-v2-rep1/cores/bench/worktrees/hyp-20261001-002-r6s1/cores/bench/generated/timing/gowin_p0/impl/pnr/core_bench.pin.html\" completed\nGenerate file \"/srv/hwebench/clones/gpt-6-astra_xhigh-v2-rep1/cores/bench/worktrees/hyp-20261001-002-r6s1/cores/bench/generated/timing/gowin_p0/impl/pnr/core_bench.rpt.html\" completed\nGenerate file \"/srv/hwebench/clones/gpt-6-astra_xhigh-v2-rep1/cores/bench/worktrees/hyp-20261001-002-r6s1/cores/bench/generated/timing/gowin_p0/impl/pnr/core_bench.rpt.txt\" completed\nGenerate file \"/srv/hwebench/clones/gpt-6-astra_xhigh-v2-rep1/cores/bench/worktrees/hyp-20261001-002-r6s1/cores/bench/generated/timing/gowin_p0/impl/pnr/core_bench.tr.html\" completed\nGenerate file \"/srv/hwebench/clones/gpt-6-astra_xhigh-v2-rep1/cores/bench/worktrees/hyp-20261001-002-r6s1/cores/bench/generated/timing/gowin_p0/impl/pnr/core_bench.tr\" completed\nThu Oct  1 13:19:32 2026\n\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
