mization without changing\\ninstruction latency. Early selection alone reached 53.726 MHz median;\\ndistributed register storage alone reached 51.074 MHz. Their combination\\nremoves both late forwarding comparisons and the slow BSRAM launch from\\nthis one timing cone. It is not a pipeline-depth or prediction change.\\n\",\n  \"hypothesis\": \"Make the existing ID/EX boundary register complete operand-source\\ndecisions alongside operand data. Use distributed RAM for the small\\nregister-file array so Gowin does not absorb its read boundary into a\\nBSRAM output. In EX, use the saved mutually exclusive enables to select\\noriginal operand sources with para\n…[14707 of 17779 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:e19bdef6c777facd]…\nesult,\\njump/link, divider completion, metadata and forwarding behavior.\\n\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"file\": \"rtl/mem_stage.sv\",\n      \"description\": \"Drive dmem_addr and all address-dependent byte-lane, alignment,\\nload extraction and RVFI memory-address logic from effective_addr.\\nKeep the general alu_result transfer into MEM/WB unchanged, along\\nwith memory enables, store data, traps, load extension and holds.\\n\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"file\": \"test/test_pipeline.py\",\n      \"description\": \"Retain existing assertions and add directed load/store address\\nchecks with ALU/load/MUL/DIV-forwarded bases, all byte/half/word\\nlanes, negative offsets and alignment traps. Exercise dmem holds,\\nsimultaneous imem stalls and same-rd producers, checking accepted\\naddresses, RVFI masks and exact-once retirement independently.\\n\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\nhyp-20261001-001-r8s0 Compare branch source candidates before forwarding selection 174.44 73.79\nhyp-20261001-001-r9s0 Balanced LUT comparison tree for conditional branch resolution 174.44 73.79\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
