description: |\n      Bank D and registered 3D by existing recurrence phase, transfer them\n      under the predecessor phase's enabled edge and consume static local\n      slices in subtraction and large-divisor checks. Preserve arithmetic,\n      widths, reset, launch, completion, sign correction and ALTOPS schedule.\n  - file: test/test_div_unit.py\n    description: |\n      Preserve exact-result and independent prefix-division checks. Add\n      local-bank validity checks at each consuming phase, changing-divisor\n      back-to-back requests, large-divisor boundaries, reset cancellation,\n      rejected busy starts and held completion in real and ALTOPS builds.\n  - file: test/test_pipeline.py\n    description: |\n      Preserve all assertions and exact-cycle expectations. Exercise mixed\n      DIV/REM dependencies, forwarded operands, consecutive distinct divisor\n      requests and simultaneous bus stalls; check original RVFI operands,\n      results, memory effects and exact-once ordered retirement.\n'''\np.write_text(s)\nh=yaml.safe_load(s)\njsonschema.validate(h,json.loads(Path('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json').read_text()))\nprint('VALID',p)\nPY\"", "aggregated_output": "", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
