ysical and RVFI memory addressing,\n      byte lanes, load extraction and alignment checks. Preserve all memory\n      enable/trap qualifications and ordinary ALU/multiply writeback data.\n  - file: test/test_pipeline.py\n    description: |\n      Preserve existing assertions and instruction timing. Add active-address\n      stability and RVFI checks spanning bubbles, division completion, each\n      forwarded base source, retained WB data, both bus stalls, byte lanes,\n      negative offsets, carry boundaries and misaligned access suppression.\n''')\nimport yaml,json,jsonschema\nh=yaml.safe_load(p.read_text());jsonschema.validate(h,json.loads(Path('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json').read_text()))\nprint('Updated hypothesis; schema validation passed.')\nPY\"", "aggregated_output": "Updated hypothesis; schema validation passed.\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
