-20261001-002-r10s1-hypgen/cores/bench/generated/hypgen_fetchbuf/rtl/if_stage.sv:111:3:      Example path: ALWAYS\n%Warning-UNOPTFLAT: /srv/hwebench/clones/gpt-6-astra_xhigh-v2-rep1/cores/bench/worktrees/hyp-20261001-002-r10s1-hypgen/cores/bench/g\n…[6712 of 9784 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:f16717aa700762b9]…\n1-002-r10s1-hypgen/cores/bench/generated/hypgen_fetchbuf/sim_build/core_multiply_altops -f Vtop.mk VM_TRACE=0 in directory /srv/hwebench/clones/gpt-6-astra_xhigh-v2-rep1/cores/bench/worktrees/hyp-20261001-002-r10s1-hypgen/cores/bench/generated/hypgen_fetchbuf/sim_build/core_multiply_altops\nINFO     Verilator:runner.py:632 Running command /srv/hwebench/clones/gpt-6-astra_xhigh-v2-rep1/cores/bench/worktrees/hyp-20261001-002-r10s1-hypgen/cores/bench/generated/hypgen_fetchbuf/sim_build/core_multiply_altops/core in directory /srv/hwebench/clones/gpt-6-astra_xhigh-v2-rep1/cores/bench/worktrees/hyp-20261001-002-r10s1-hypgen/cores/bench/generated/hypgen_fetchbuf/test\nERROR    Verilator:runner.py:572 ERROR: Failed 5 of 38 tests.\n=========================== short test summary info ============================\nFAILED cores/bench/generated/hypgen_fetchbuf/test/test_pipeline.py::test_pipeline_runner\nFAILED cores/bench/generated/hypgen_fetchbuf/test/test_pipeline.py::test_multiply_altops_pipeline_runner\n2 failed in 38.52s\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
