instruction bus is\nstalled. Any same-edge wrong-path payload capture remains invalid.\nReset initializes both payload registers deterministically. Compute\npredictions'\"'''+s[b+len('Compute\\\\npredictions'):]\na=s.index('The initial seven-percent')\nb=s.index('Preserve existing test coverage',a)\ns=s[:a]+'''A prototype of exactly this two-entry fall-through queue with the\npayload enables above completed canonical stalled CoreMark in\n3,981,061 bracketed cycles, versus 4,230,003 for the champion, and\npassed the canonical CRCs, UART validation, marker and bounds checks.\nGowin placement options 0/1/2 measured 70.727,73.832,73.832 MHz,\nmedian 73.832 MHz. Preliminary fitness is 185.45810 iter/sec, a\n6.32-percent gain over 174.44, above the required 182.46424 threshold.\nOption-zero resources were 5,557 LUT4s, 1,346 registers, 40 LUT-RAMs,\nfour BSRAMs and two DSPs. The six-percent forecast rounds this result;\nreproduce it on implementation before claiming champion replacement.\n\nResponse-qualified, priority-selected payload writes in an otherwise\nidentical two-entry queue measured only 59.337 MHz, despite identical\nCoreMark cycles. Thus merely adding capacity is insufficient: retain\nthe simple payload equations and separate valid-bit discipline above.\nThe final refinement is undergoing formal and directed qualification;\ncomplete results and any limitations must be checked before acceptance.\nMain risks are synthesis/routing differences consuming the remaining\nmargin, incorrect invalid-payload handling, and regressions in saved\npredictions or retained forwarding across longer independent fetches.\n\n'''+s[b:]\nd['hypothesis']=s\nd['expected_impact']={'fitness_delta_pct':6,'confidence':'medium'}\nd['changes'][0]['description']+='Use head_load=head_valid XOR stall and tail_load=head_valid && (\"'!tail_valid || !stall); do not gate payload enables with response-ready, fetch_accept or recovery. Keep valid-bit updates response-qualified.'\"\\\\n'\np.write_text(yaml.safe_dump(d,sort_keys=False,default_style=None,width=78))\nPY\"", "aggregated_output": "", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
