ting single-issue pipeline, combinational RV32I ALU,\\nand multiplier. Remove real combinational / and % from the synthesized\\ncore. This is one structural change: decouple long division from ordinary\\nsingle-cycle execution, without adding a cache, predictor, or wider issue.\\n\\nCapture the fully forwarded operands, operation, signedness, and RV\n…[132312 of 135384 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:cb3599025cca5f22]…\n\\nconsume/refill, unready responses captured only into invalid slots,\\nlong backend holds, stable valid payloads, redirects at each occupancy\\nand reset with a full queue. Check accepted instruction/PC/prediction\\norder and request-PC progression independently of RTL valid equations.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 180.14, \"delta_pct\": 3.27, \"vs_baseline\": 1386.3, \"fmax_mhz\": 71.714, \"ipc_coremark\": 3e-06, \"cycles\": 3981061, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 5502, \"ff\": 1346, \"seeds\": [73.164, 71.714, 71.714], \"perturbations\": [[0, 73.164, 14], [1, 71.714, 14], [2, 71.714, 14]], \"lutram\": 40, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_ex/reg_q.alu_result_26_s0\", \"to\": \"dmem_0_dmem_0_0_0_s\", \"slack_ns\": -8.668, \"arrival_ns\": 18.963, \"logic_cells\": 14, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 14, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-01T14:59:48.619947Z\", \"slot\": 1, \"round_id\": 11}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
