{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"agent_message","text":"The recent fetch queues saved about 6% in cycles, but their added selection paths cost enough frequency to miss acceptance. The recurring timing bottleneck is forwarded operands through EX arithmetic and branch recovery; I’m looking for a structural change that shortens those paths."}}
