; at 4,230,003 cycles that needs about 77.183 MHz.\n\nA separate exploratory prototype with a registered recovery boundary was rejected because an extra recovery cycle followed by division failed the unchanged bounded-liveness check. Do not adopt delayed recovery or relax that check. This proposal preserves the champion's recovery and division latencies and targets only the combinational prediction-checking path.\n\nPreserve nret=1, all top-level ports and RVFI fields, decoder legality, misalignment traps, exact-once retirement, memory handshakes, real and ALTOPS arithmetic, and every invariant. Prove combinational equivalence of selected branch_cond to comparing the original forwarded operands for all operand values, all branch_op values and all nine legal one-hot source combinations. Run the existing pipeline predictor and operand monitors unchanged, the unchanged formal suite and full-RVFI cosim, then canonical stalled CoreMark validation and all three Gowin placement options.''',\n'expected_impact':{'fitness_delta_pct':5,'confidence':'low'},\n'changes':[\n {'file':'rtl/ex_stage.sv','description':'''Compute branch predicates for every prospective rs1/rs2 forwarding-source pair in parallel, then select the one-bit result using the existing registered one-hot raw masks. Share equality, signed/unsigned ordering and complements within pairs; fold identical-source cases. Preserve all other execution, recovery, training, target, trap and pipeline-enable equations and every arithmetic datapath.'''},\n {'file':'test/test_pipeline.py','description':'''Keep existing predictor counter, recovery timing, exact-cycle, operand and architectural assertions unchanged. Add directed branches covering every legal condition and all nine forwarding source combinations, including identical-source pairs, younger-over-older writer priority, x0, signed extrema and unsigned high-bit cases. Exercise both prediction outcomes, load/multiply-use bubbles, held dmem forwarding, simultaneous imem stalls, completed division and misaligned taken targets. Check exact RVFI operands/PCs, once-only training, no wrong-path memory effects and unchanged retirement progress.'''}]}\nclass Dumper(yaml.SafeDumper): pass\ndef represent(dumper,s):\n return dumper.represent_scalar('tag:yaml.org,2002:str',s,style='|' if '\\\\n' in s or len(s)>110 else None)\nDumper.add_representer(str,represent)\np.write_text(yaml.dump(d,Dumper=Dumper,sort_keys=False,width=90))\nimport json,jsonschema\njsonschema.validate(d,json.load(open('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json')))\nprint('Replaced and schema-validated:',p)\nPY\"", "aggregated_output": "Replaced and schema-validated: cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261001-003-r10s2.yaml\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
