ready-muxed\n  rs1 or rs2 buses.\n\n  Each pair evaluates BEQ/BNE, BLT/BGE and BLTU/BGEU with the exact existing\n  signed and unsigned semantics; reserved branch_op values yield false. Express\n  equality once and unsigned less-than once per pair, derive signed less-than\n  from differing sign\n…[3811 of 6883 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:47dde697db40b3c9]…\nisting\n    registered one-hot raw masks. Share equality, signed/unsigned ordering and\n    complements within each pair; identical EX/MEM-versus-EX/MEM and MEM/WB-\n    versus-MEM/WB source pairs are constant. Preserve every other execution,\n    recovery, training, target, trap and pipeline-enable equation and all\n    arithmetic datapaths.\n- file: test/test_pipeline.py\n  description: |\n    Keep existing predictor counter, recovery timing, exact-cycle, operand and\n    architectural assertions unchanged. Add directed branches covering every\n    legal condition and all nine forwarding source combinations, including\n    identical-source pairs, younger-over-older writer priority, x0, signed\n    extrema and unsigned high-bit cases. Exercise both prediction outcomes,\n    load/multiply-use bubbles, held dmem forwarding, simultaneous imem stalls,\n    completed division and misaligned taken targets. Check exact RVFI\n    operands/PCs, once-only training, no wrong-path memory effects and unchanged\n    retirement progress.\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
