onal RV32I ALU,\\nand multiplier. Remove real combinational / and % from the synthesized\\ncore. This is one structural change: decouple long division from ordinary\\nsingle-cycle execution, without adding a cache, predictor, or wider issue.\\n\\nCapture the fully forwarded operands, operation, signedness, and RV\n…[20460 of 23532 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:10d2a8c7070f96d2]…\nged.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 13.32, \"delta_pct\": 9.9, \"vs_baseline\": 9.9, \"fmax_mhz\": 5.596, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4202246, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 12917, \"ff\": 718, \"seeds\": [5.226, 5.596, 5.596], \"perturbations\": [[0, 5.226, 156], [1, 5.596, 148], [2, 5.596, 148]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.rs2_addr_0_s0\", \"to\": \"dmem_1_dmem_1_0_0_s\", \"slack_ns\": -186.361, \"arrival_ns\": 196.656, \"logic_cells\": 159, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_fwd\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 156, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-01T09:19:46.385821Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 1, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-10-01 hyp-20261001-003-r1s2 (regression, +9.90%): Local saturating updates in the 128-entry bimodal table avoid a second indexed counter read mux and shared write-data fanout, raising median Gowin Fmax from 5.204 to 5.596 MHz at unchanged CoreMark cycles.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
